## Reviewer got this wrong (not applied)

- Space as the Estonian thousands separator, and "1,57 miljonit TWD" for the pinned bio figure. The checker accepts only dot grouping for et, and a test pins TWD 1.57M byte-identical.
- Q16–Q20 should become headings, and U+200B lines are an Estonian-only defect. The Korean source has the same heading levels and the same ZWSP counts. Deleting them fails the structural check.
- "Alates 1. juulist 2026" and "24. jaanuari 2022. aasta". DATE_MONTH_NAMES lists only nominative jaanuar and juuli. The elative/genitive does not match the date regex, so month 7 or month 1 drops out of the number bag and the file fails. The grammatical fix that still parses is "Alates kuupäevast 1. juuli 2026" and "24. jaanuar 2022 kuupäevaga … otsusega".
- Closings of 009 use tõotama. 009 has no form of tõotama. The insurance sentence in row 30 was still fixed.

